{"slug":"zz-l-l","ar":"ظ ل ل","total":33,"core":"shade; remaining","forms":[{"ar":"ظِلّ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":14,"gloss":"shade, shadow","word":null,"ex":{"s":56,"a":30,"p":1,"ar":["وَظِلٍّ","مَّمْدُودٍ"],"en":"And shade extended"}},{"ar":"ظَلَّ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":9,"gloss":"to remain, continue","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":71,"p":4,"ar":["قَالُوا۟","نَعْبُدُ","أَصْنَامًا","فَنَظَلُّ","لَهَا","عَـٰكِفِينَ"],"en":"They said, \"We worship idols and remain to them devoted"}},{"ar":"ظُلَّة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":6,"gloss":"canopy, covering","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":189,"p":5,"ar":["فَكَذَّبُوهُ","فَأَخَذَهُمْ","عَذَابُ","يَوْمِ","ٱلظُّلَّةِ ۚ","إِنَّهُۥ","كَانَ","عَذَابَ","يَوْمٍ","عَظِيمٍ"],"en":"And they denied him, so the punishment of the day of the black cloud seized them. Indeed, it was the punishment of a terrible day"}},{"ar":"ظَلِيل","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"shady","word":null,"ex":{"s":77,"a":31,"p":2,"ar":["لَّا","ظَلِيلٍ","وَلَا","يُغْنِى","مِنَ","ٱللَّهَبِ"],"en":"[But having] no cool shade and availing not against the flame"}},{"ar":"ظَلَّلْ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":2,"gloss":"to shade","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":57,"p":1,"ar":["وَظَلَّلْنَا","عَلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْغَمَامَ","وَأَنزَلْنَا","عَلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْمَنَّ","وَٱلسَّلْوَىٰ ۖ","كُلُوا۟","مِن","طَيِّبَـٰتِ","مَا","رَزَقْنَـٰكُمْ ۖ","وَمَا","ظَلَمُونَا","وَلَـٰكِن","كَانُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَهُمْ","يَظْلِمُونَ"],"en":"And We shaded you with clouds and sent down to you manna and quails, [saying], \"Eat from the good things with which We have provided you.\" And they wronged Us not - but they were [only] wronging themselves"}}],"surahs":[[16,3],[26,3],[56,3],[77,3],[2,2],[4,2],[7,2],[13,2],[39,2],[15,1],[20,1],[25,1],[28,1],[30,1],[31,1],[35,1],[36,1],[42,1],[43,1],[76,1]]}